001652                    ; SDB_BLK2B
001653                    ; Converts a 512-byte block index into a byte position (unsigned 32 bit).
001654                    ;
001655                    ; Input: R9/R10: block index lo/hi
001656                    ; Output: R9/R10: byte position lo/hi
