001669                    ; SDB_CLULBA
001670                    ; The absolute SD card LBA of one sector within one cluster, i.e. exactly
001671                    ; what FAT32$RW_SIC computes, with every range check spelled out.
001672                    ;
001673                    ; Input: R8: device handle
001674                    ; R9/R10: cluster lo/hi
001675                    ; R11: sector within the cluster
001676                    ; Output: Carry=1: R9/R10 = LBA lo/hi
001677                    ; Carry=0: the cluster or the sector is out of range
001678                    ; R8, R11 unchanged
